Subject: Cantor SJS Compiled Lookahead Stitch P0 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] b146697b-06da-4b41-81eb-7f26cd94e51f
@ [canonical_uuid] 5b57d004-0a43-4d89-9c5a-6dc671a2a05a

& [Need]
  + the preserved source distinguishes a lightweight semantic stitch from a broad prompt restatement and requires exact persistence across host boundaries
  + without an executable provider-free waist later host work could silently mutate identity promote plan hints to authority or mistake model context for custody

& [Choice]
  + form the pure compiler lifecycle and projection-record contract first with one-or-two-stitch bounds exact predicates and independent replay

& [Value]
  + the result can become the audited forward input to minimum-recoverable-frame work while leaving host projection and performance measurement separately gated
